{"speciesId":53,"names":{"fr":"Persian","es":"Persian","en":"Persian","ja":"ペルシアン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"Although its fur has many admirers, it is tough to raise as a pet because of its fickle meanness."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"Although its fur has many admirers, it is tough to raise as a pet because of its fickle meanness."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"The gem in its forehead glows on its own! It walks with all the grace and elegance of a proud queen."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Many adore it for its sophisticated air. However, it will lash out and scratch for little reason."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Its lithe muscles allow it to walk without making a sound. It attacks in an instant."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Behind its lithe, elegant appearance lies a barbaric side. It will tear apart its prey on a mere whim."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"PERSIAN has six bold whiskers that give it a look of toughness. The whiskers sense air movements to determine what is in the POKéMON’s surrounding vicinity. It becomes docile if grabbed by the whiskers."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"PERSIAN has six bold whiskers that give it a look of toughness. The whiskers sense air movements to determine what is in the POKéMON’s surrounding vicinity. It becomes docile if grabbed by the whiskers."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A PERSIAN’s six bold whiskers sense air movements to determine what is in its vicinity. It becomes docile if grabbed by the whiskers."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Has a vicious temperament. Beware if it raises its tail straight up. It is a signal that it is about to pounce and bite."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Although its fur has many admirers, it is tough to raise as a pet because of its fickle meanness."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"A very haughty Pokémon. Among fans, the size of the jewel in its forehead is a topic of much talk."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"A very haughty Pokémon. Among fans, the size of the jewel in its forehead is a topic of much talk."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"A very haughty Pokémon. Among fans, the size of the jewel in its forehead is a topic of much talk."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Many adore it for its sophisticated air. However, it will lash out and scratch for little reason."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its lithe muscles allow it to walk without making a sound. It attacks in an instant."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Un Pokémon très snob. La taille du joyau qui orne son front alimente bien des débats parmi ses fans."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"A very haughty Pokémon. Among fans, the size of the jewel in its forehead is a topic of much talk."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Un Pokémon très snob. La taille du joyau qui orne son front alimente bien des débats parmi ses fans."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"A very haughty Pokémon. Among fans, the size of the jewel in its forehead is a topic of much talk."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"A very haughty Pokémon. Among fans, the size of the jewel in its forehead is a topic of much talk."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"A very haughty Pokémon. Among fans, the size of the jewel in its forehead is a topic of much talk."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Très apprécié pour sa fourrure, il est difficile à apprivoiser en raison de son caractère rétif."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Aunque es muy admirado por el pelo, es difícil de entrenar como mascota, porque es un poco travieso."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Although its fur has many admirers, it is tough to raise as a pet because of its fickle meanness."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"毛並みが 美しく ペットにしたがる 人も 多いが すぐ ひっかいたり するので 手強いぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ses muscles souples lui permettent de marcher sans un bruit et d’attaquer en l’espace d’un instant."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Sus ágiles músculos le permiten moverse sin hacer ruido. Ataca al instante."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its lithe muscles allow it to walk without making a sound. It attacks in an instant."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"しなやかな 筋肉の おかげで 足音ひとつ 立てずに 歩ける。 獲物を 狩るときは 一瞬。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Persian a six grosses vibrisses qui lui donnent un air costaud et lui permettent de sentir les mouvements de l’air pour savoir ce qui se trouve à proximité. Il devient docile lorsqu’on l’attrape par les moustaches."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Persian tiene seis llamativos bigotes que le dan un aspecto feroz. Además, le sirven para detectar el movimiento del aire, delator de la presencia cercana de algún Pokémon. Si se le agarra por los bigotes, se vuelve dócil."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Persian has six bold whiskers that give it a look of toughness. The whiskers sense air movements to determine what is in the Pokémon’s surrounding vicinity. It becomes docile if grabbed by the whiskers."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"たくましい ６本の ヒゲは 空気の 動きで 周りの 様子を キャッチする 役割。 ヒゲを つかまれると 大人しくなって しまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Persian a six grosses vibrisses qui lui donnent un air costaud et lui permettent de sentir les mouvements de l’air pour savoir ce qui se trouve à proximité. Il devient docile lorsqu’on l’attrape par les moustaches."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Persian tiene seis llamativos bigotes que le dan un aspecto feroz. Además, le sirven para detectar el movimiento del aire, delator de la presencia cercana de algún Pokémon. Si se le agarra por los bigotes, se vuelve dócil."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Persian has six bold whiskers that give it a look of toughness. The whiskers sense air movements to determine what is in the Pokémon’s surrounding vicinity. It becomes docile if grabbed by the whiskers."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"たくましい ６本の ヒゲは 空気の 動きで 周りの 様子を キャッチする 役割。 ヒゲを つかまれると 大人しくなって しまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Un Pokémon très agressif, qui peut sauter à la gorge si on le regarde dans les yeux. Ses griffes acérées infligent de graves blessures."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"De temperamento violento, ataca a cualquiera que lo mira directamente a los ojos. Sus afiladas garras infligen heridas muy profundas."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It has a violent temperament. It will attack anything that looks it in the eye. Its sharp claws inflict deep wounds."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"気性が 荒く 目が 合うだけで 飛び掛ってくる。 鋭いツメに やられると 深い 傷を 負う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Un Pokémon naturellement fier, mais pas aussi orgueilleux que les Persian d’Alola. Il est très difficile à apprivoiser."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Los Persian son Pokémon extremadamente orgullosos, en especial los de Alola. No es fácil hacerse amigo de este Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It has a high opinion of itself, although not to the same extent as the Alolan Persian. It’s quite difficult to make friends with this Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"アローラの ペルシアンほどではないが 気位の 高い 性質。 懐かせるのが かなり 難しい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Malgré une composition quasiment identique, sa gemme est d’une couleur différente de celle du Persian d’Alola."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"La joya que luce en la frente presenta una coloración distinta a la del Persian de Alola, aunque la composición es casi idéntica."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Although the jewel on its forehead appears to be a different color than those of Alolan Persian, it’s mostly made of the same material."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"アローラの ペルシアンとは 額の 宝石の色が 違って 見えるが 成分は あまり 変わらないのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Un Pokémon prisé des classes aisées. Il est néanmoins la cible des voleurs convoitant la gemme qui orne son front."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Un Pokémon de alto copete, objetivo primordial de ladrones que quieren apoderarse de la joya que luce en la frente."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"This Pokémon is popular with rich people. It’s also targeted by hunters who are after the jewel in its forehead."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"お金持ちに 人気の ポケモン。 額の 宝石を 狙って ハンターたちに 狙われることも。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"La pierre sur son front brille de mille feux. Sa démarche est souple et majestueuse."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"La gema que tiene en la frente brilla por sí misma. Camina con elegancia regia."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"The gem in its forehead glows on its own! It walks with all the grace and elegance of a proud queen."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"額に 宝石が 輝く！ また 歩く姿も しなやかで 王女のような 華やかさがある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"La pierre sur son front brille de mille feux. Sa démarche est souple et majestueuse."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"La gema que tiene en la frente brilla por sí misma. Camina con elegancia regia."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"The gem in its forehead glows on its own! It walks with all the grace and elegance of a proud queen."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"額に 宝石が 輝く！ また 歩く姿も しなやかで 王女のような 華やかさがある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Très fier, il est difficile à apprivoiser. Dès que quelque chose ne lui plaît pas, il sort les griffes."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Trabar amistad con este Pokémon es una ardua tarea debido a su enorme orgullo. Cuando algo no le place, saca las uñas de inmediato."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Getting this prideful Pokémon to warm up to you takes a lot of effort, and it will claw at you the moment it gets annoyed."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"気位が 高く なつかせるのは たいへん。 気に食わない ことが あると すぐに ツメを 立ててくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il se comporte avec grâce et élégance, et ne s’entend pas avec les rustres Berserkatt : les deux espèces se méprisent."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Hace gala de un porte elegante y majestuoso. No congenia con los toscos Perrserker y ambos se profesan un mutuo desprecio."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Its elegant and refined behavior clashes with that of the barbaric Perrserker. The relationship between the two is one of mutual disdain."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"優雅で 上品な 身のこなし。 野蛮な ニャイキングとは そりが あわず お互いを 見下している。"}],"varieties":[{"id":53,"moves":[{"name":"pay-day","learns":[[1,"level-up",17],[1,"machine",0],[2,"level-up",17],[2,"machine",0],[3,"level-up",20],[4,"level-up",20],[5,"level-up",20],[6,"level-up",20],[7,"level-up",18],[12,"level-up",20],[13,"level-up",20],[19,"level-up",12],[19,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",12],[20,"machine",0],[23,"level-up",12],[25,"level-up",12],[28,"level-up",17],[28,"machine",0],[29,"level-up",17],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"scratch","learns":[[1,"level-up",1],[2,"level-up",1],[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[19,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[28,"level-up",1],[29,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"ma